a pech~
A pech stops his mining and looks at you with interest.
~
This four foot tall, spindly, bearded creature has pale, yellowish skin that 
at first glance appears as hard as granite.  It's hair is shoulder length and 
a reddish-brown color as is it's beard.  It has long, thin arms and legs but 
it's feet and hands are very broad and strong looking.  It's large, pupiless 
eyes look as if they could see literally anything.  
~
